  "notes": "## Changes since `v0.7.2-beta.15`\n\n### Fixes\n\n- bundle the Linux beta RPM in its own step as version 0.7.2 with release beta.N, since tauri cli 2.12.4 refuses the '-' of a prerelease in an RPM version and failed the whole Linux beta build; the RPM reuses the binary built for the AppImage and deb, so the app still reports the full beta version to the updater, and RPM epoch 1 is set for every Linux build so beta.10 to beta.14, which shipped as version 0.7.2-beta.N and which rpm ranks above 0.7.2, can still be upgraded with rpm -U; the epoch must never go back to 0 ([c3fb1fbc](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/commit/c3fb1fbcaf51b040ea4c69168a5774a4563dceb5))\n\n**Full comparison:** [v0.7.2-beta.15...v0.7.2-beta.16](https://github.com/330079598/tTerm/compare/v0.7.2-beta.15...v0.7.2-beta.16)",
